{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 90725, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 63508, "uid": 92835, "type": 4, "title": "玩偶", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1635340312, "updated_at": 1660799766, "updated_uid": 92835, "comment_at": 1682140479, "last_at": 1688549665, "comment_count": 32, "status": 1, "summary": "总结在前面各位最关心的：玩偶的获取渠道，目前官方的消息，有以下几种：1.打<太空漫步>星簇boss，详情点击这里2.铁匠打造3.氪金逐个分析：铁匠：材料难得而且锻造紫色一个需要100W玛瑙，此途径获取", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635341873410_61999902.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635342600460_45779173.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635343177694_81528391.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 25, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 80036, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 13, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 90725, "content": "<div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">总结在前面</div></div><br></div><div>各位最关心的：玩偶的获取渠道，目前官方的消息，有以下几种：</div><div>1. 打&lt;太空漫步&gt;星簇boss，详情<a href=\"http://destinychild.gamekee.com/90679.html\">点击这里</a></div><div>2. 铁匠打造</div><div>3. 氪金</div><div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\">逐个分析：</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">铁匠：材料难得而且锻造紫色一个需要100W玛瑙，此途径获取玩偶的数量十分有限。</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">氪金：560一个紫色玩偶 ？！</span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">太空漫步：推完星云每天给48张乳贴boss门票和48张狐狸boss门票48张亚里亚。打的过程中可以点击中间的暂停退出，退出不消耗票，打不过没关系，票可以攒着，等有实力的时候再来打。</span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">介绍</div></div><div></div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><div>每个天子新增一个挂件槽，用于放置玩偶，只能佩戴和天子属性相同的玩偶（<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">同属性即可</span>）。</div><div>那这里的可操作性可就大了，终极缝合怪，打造超级天子。虽然我是刀，但是我打你同时让自己免控或者无敌很合理吧？！</div><div><div class=\"div-img\"></div></div></span><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635341873410_61999902.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635341873410_61999902.png\" data-width=\"590\" data-height=\"820\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 182, 79);\">玩偶玩法介绍</div></div><br></div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 182, 79);\">玩偶可以强化天子的技能</span></span></div></div><br></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\">例1：</span></div><div>佩戴【<span style=\"text-align: center;\">暗月月</span>玩偶】强化了两个技能，翻译如下：</div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\">普通技能强化：</span></span></div><div>强化1：一名暗属性攻击性友军获得双刃（<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">攻击力增加100%并且防御减低</span>），持续10S。（这就有点变态了啊，这可是1级技能，如果升满<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">从此</span>RD中暗双刃直接永久性下岗，一个挂件就把一个角色替代了）（给暗百分比刀，n的同时给自己加双刃，离了大谱）</div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\">队长技能强化：</span></span></div><div>强化1：暗属性队友暴击率增加12.5%</div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635342600460_45779173.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635342600460_45779173.png\" data-width=\"573\" data-height=\"922\"></div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\">例2：</span></div><div>【<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">嫦娥玩偶</span>】强化技能如下：</div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\">DS技能强化：</span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">强化1：友军3体50%概率技能完全填充。</div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">强化2：DS条增加25%。（一级加25%的DS条？？预计满级加50%+，什么概念？？？此玩偶配合DS条填充量增加的buff，直接秒下一个DS，你怎么扛？）</div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">队长技能强化：</span><br style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">强化1：技能【填充量】+15%（满级预计30%+，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">可以猜到以后pvp如果不带玩偶，转速基本被别人吊打</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">）<br><br></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><div></div></span><div></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635343177694_81528391.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635343177694_81528391.png\" data-width=\"579\" data-height=\"591\"></div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">操作玩偶</div></div><br></div><div>翻译如图：卸掉消耗400材料（比点火石好不会拿不下来），如果给的是低级玩偶卸掉的材料不值的话，可以直接卖掉，返还【玩偶用洗剂】。</div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635344200333_32645279.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635344200333_32645279.png\" data-width=\"582\" data-height=\"700\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"line-height: 3;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">升级和突破</div></div></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\">玩偶升级使用玩偶或者升级材料（棉花），升级其实就是升级技能，等级上限通过加值来提高。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635344382197_36015418.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635344382197_36015418.png\" data-width=\"599\" data-height=\"1000\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">将一个+0的玩偶升到+6，需要金币<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">八百四十万</span>，可以注意到，玩偶类似魂卡，喂+5的玩偶，可以使+0直接成+6。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635344526536_75626861.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635344526536_75626861.png\" data-width=\"600\" data-height=\"1000\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">玩偶制作</span></div></div><br></div>普通白色玩偶<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">一万</span>玛瑙，绿色罕见玩偶<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">四万</span>玛瑙，蓝色稀有玩偶<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">四十万</span>玛瑙，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">紫色玩偶一百万玛瑙</span>？橙色传说玩偶<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">四百万？？</span></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635344691999_86473757.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635344691999_86473757.png\" data-width=\"600\" data-height=\"999\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">透视画馆</div></div><br></div><div>离了超大谱的系统，继天子羁绊之后又一个全游buff，但这个不是单一buff，而是<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">所有buff一起生效</span></span></span>！！一共56个buff。放到buff中的玩偶不能使用，所以<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">必须是闲置的玩偶</span></span>。</div><div>buff分别是</div><div>1. 2个传说buff&nbsp; &nbsp;= 10 个<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">闲置的</span>传说玩偶<br></div><div>2. 8个史诗buff&nbsp; &nbsp;= 40 个<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">闲置的</span>史诗玩偶</div><div>3. 13个稀有buff = 65 个闲置的稀有玩偶</div><div>4. 16个罕见buff = 80&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">个<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">罕见</span>的稀有玩偶</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">5.17个普通buff&nbsp; = 85&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">个</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">罕见</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">的</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">稀有玩偶</span></span></div><div>以上是所有一级buff生效的条件，buff要升到满级，上面的这些全都要升到70级，这还都是闲置的，真正自己使用的不算。</div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635907122547_75610257.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635907122547_75610257.png\" data-width=\"655\" data-height=\"1073\"></div><br></div><br></div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635341873410_61999902.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635342600460_45779173.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635343177694_81528391.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 92835, "username": "海洋饼干", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/5.png", "description": "两岸猿声啼不住，轻舟已过万重山", "follow_num": 859, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "海洋超人", "tag_color": "#FF0000"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 97969